@startuml
title Timing Diagram: Watchdog Timeout (PACKET_LOSS)

' Forces PlantUML to stretch the X-axis for readability
scale 10 as 120 pixels

robust "Drone 2" as D2
robust "Scheduler" as SCH
robust "Watchdog" as WD

@0
D2 is IDLE
SCH is LISTENING
WD is IDLE

@5
SCH is DISPATCHING
SCH -> D2 : UDP CMD (PACKET_LOSS)
WD is RUNNING

@10
SCH is LISTENING
D2 is EN_ROUTE

@35
WD is TIMEOUT
WD -> SCH : Timeout Triggered

@40
SCH is RECOVERY
WD is IDLE

@45
SCH -> SCH : Dispatch to Drone 1
SCH is LISTENING
@enduml